00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:44.420
with our spelling today, yes Judy?

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:46.880
- Aren't we gonna have our discussion period today?

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:48.720
Like you promised.

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:50.960
- Yes, yes of course.

