Now, we were discussing World War II, isn't that right?

00:18:56.390 --> 00:19:00.000
Now, as we were saying, World War II has

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:02.490
certain unique causes all of its own.

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:07.110
As a matter of fact, all wars have certain kinds

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:10.690
of interesting beginnings and peculiar types of beginnings.

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:14.160
Now, you take the War of 1812.

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:17.040
Now, to understand the War of 1812,

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:20.220
